OL,3,GNEWSAStrike called over train safety
OL,4,Aconcerns suspended
OL,5,
OL,6,FStrike action set to take place amid a
OL,7,Frow involving East Midlands Railway
OL,8,F(EMR) over safety concerns with a new
OL,9,Ffleet of trains has been suspended.
OL,11,FThe RMT union has been in dispute with
OL,12,Fthe firm since April following the
OL,13,Frollout of the Aurora (Class 810)
OL,14,Ffleet, which the union said had been
OL,15,Foperating with a "significant number"
OL,16,Fof faults.
OL,18,FUnion members were set to strike for 24
OL,19,Fhours from 12:00 BST on Wednesday but a
OL,20,Fspokesperson for RMT confirmed the
OL,21,Faction had been suspended following
OL,22,F"substantial movement from management".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
